			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate POSIX shell compliance across Land submodules\n\nUpdate five submodules to use POSIX-compliant sh shebang instead of bash in build scripts:\n- Output: Make shell scripts POSIX-compliant (prepublishOnly.sh, Run.sh)\n- Rest: Convert bash-specific scripts to portable POSIX sh syntax\n- Wind: Use POSIX sh shebang for build scripts\n- Worker: Use POSIX-compliant sh shebang in build scripts\n- Cocoon: Implement progress IPC notifications to Mountain\n\nThe Cocoon submodule also includes a new feature: implementing actual gRPC notifications for the WithProgress API, enabling Mountain backend to display real-time progress indicators during extension execution.\n\nThis coordinated update ensures consistent shell compatibility across the Land ecosystem while adding the progress notification capability to the extension host.",
			"SHA": "dc77d54e7ce0cd5d655a5a489364e659958226de"
