			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate documentation submodule updates across Echo, Grove, Maintain\n\nSynchronize Documentation/Rust submodule across three Land components:\n- Echo: Advance Documentation/Rust from 4650a158 to 3766949b\n- Grove: Advance Documentation/Rust from 8b6224b9 to 0c52283d\n- Maintain: Advance Documentation/Rust from 8b6224b9 to 0c52283d plus improve markdown table formatting in DeepDive.md and normalize rustdocflags in .cargo/config.toml\n\nThis routine coordination keeps Land's documentation dependencies current while improving readability of maintenance documentation.",
			"SHA": "23ee370ec1ddd0ba388b69d5532fc36c3dfb4358"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-06T03:39:28Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⠇⠀⠀",
				28,
				13
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Coordinate submodule updates with Window IPC and provider transport\n\nCoordinate Land ecosystem updates with significant feature additions:\n\n**Cocoon:** Implement actual gRPC calls in WindowService - status bar operations now send setStatusBarText, setStatusBarTooltip, disposeStatusBarItem notifications; output channels fully implement create, append, appendLine, clear, show, dispose IPC.\n\n**Grove:** Wire VSCodeAPI and LanguageNamespace to Transport for forwarding provider registrations to Mountain. When transport is connected, each register_*_provider call sends a JSON notification with handle, language_selector, and extension_id to Mountain's ProviderRegistry.\n\n**Styling/Docs:** Apply consistent formatting across all submodules - ESBuild configs reformatted from minified to readable, table column widths adjusted in DeepDive.md, quote standardization in JavaScript files, cargo config array formatting.\n\nThis completes the Window service integration layer and enables Mountain to track provider registrations from Grove extensions.",
			"SHA": "444443f273c18f2414055f5fa3e82573f4eeabd2"
		},
