			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): update workspace folder access from async to sync API\n\nUpdate WindServiceHandlers and CocoonService to use the new synchronous workspace folder API. Replace async GetFolders().await with synchronous GetWorkspaceFolders() in handlers for getFolders, findInFiles, and findFiles. Refactor addFolder and removeFolder to use direct folder manipulation via GetWorkspaceFolders/SetWorkspaceFolders instead of async AddFolder/RemoveFolder methods. Fix field access to use Folder.URI.to_string() for consistency with the updated DTO structure. Add missing IgnoreFocusOut field to the showInputBox handler.\n\nThis aligns with the updated Common library API where workspace folder operations are now synchronous, removing the need for async/await in workspace folder handlers.",
			"SHA": "5311bf5d29aeb9891a5fc4dd1179334311710b61"
		}
